ADDITIONAL NOTICE

This project demonstrates standards-based digital signing and verification. It
is NOT a legally recognised electronic signature service, and the MIT licence
above grants no warranty of fitness for any such purpose.

Production, legally recognised signing generally requires approved certificate
providers, jurisdiction-specific compliance, qualified trust services, certified
hardware security modules, organisational PKI policy, and licensed eSign
providers where applicable. This software makes no claim to any of these.

The development PKI generated by this project carries no external trust and must
never be used to sign anything of legal or commercial value.
